{"4114540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "🥔 Not So Hot Potato: 2025 Final Boss 🥔", "steam_appid": 4114540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Throw 🥔 Catch 🥔</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And... don't cry 😄</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Also don't fail I'd say</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Not So Hot Potato: 2025 Final Boss&quot;</strong> is NOT a punishing game but it can be a pain in a$$ sometimes to be totally honest. Don't worry much, just throw/catch (if you can) while you try to survive the traps and pushing forward. You may regret your decisions once you throw the potato or once you do a simple jump but it will be too late for sure... your <i>problem</i> really 💀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, once you get there and finish it the relief will be <strong>priceless!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥔 Realistic potato physics (more or less)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 A journey from the ground to the clouds — maybe even space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Fail once and... just don't fail</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👬 Optional co-op to suffer together </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😤 Not-so-calm gameplay but it'll be fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114540/extras/8dbef3be3862ef45749562df76e2345e.poster.avif?t=1765119444\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114540/extras/8dbef3be3862ef45749562df76e2345e.webm?t=1765119444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traps</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l